Title: Elevator Hero

INT. OFFICE ELEVATOR - MORNING

ALEX enters carrying six coffees, a laptop bag, and a stack of folders.

The elevator doors begin to close.

ALEX
Hold it!

He tries to stop the doors with his foot.

One coffee tilts.

Alex catches it with his elbow.

The folders begin sliding.

He traps them against the wall with his shoulder.

The laptop bag slips from his arm and catches around his ankle.

The elevator doors open again.

Inside, five coworkers silently watch him struggle.

Alex straightens as much as possible.

ALEX
Morning.

One lid pops off a coffee.

Foam lands directly on his forehead.

No one speaks.

DING.

The doors close.
